&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Oracle.html&quot; title=&quot;L&amp;#39;oracle&quot;&gt;Oracle&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/b&gt; L’oracle ajoute +1 &#224; ses tests de &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Lancer-Des-Sorts#Concentration.html&quot; title=&quot;Concentration&quot;&gt;concentration&lt;/a&gt; pour lancer des sorts du &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Cr&#233;er-Un-Sort#Registre.html&quot; title=&quot;Registre&quot;&gt;registre&lt;/a&gt; du feu.

